# Every text the API compatibility family shipped at a managed path, oldest first:
# "<sha256>  <path>", the digest taken over the text with LF line endings. The last line of a
# path is its current text; every earlier line must be in the family's Prior
# (tools/apicompat/assets.go priorDigests). TestShippedTextLedger
# (internal/managedasset/shipped_texts_test.go) enforces both directions. After a managed text
# changes, for example when Renovate moves a pin of the hosted workflow:
#   PRAETOR_UPDATE_SHIPPED_TEXTS=1 go test ./internal/managedasset -run 'TestShippedTextLedger$'
# appends the new digest; then record the outgoing text in the family's Prior. Never rewrite or
# drop a line.
a123aa00616a9ee913dda943e288a64f8f3e3518b7777a4f8ed866c10c47f37e  .github/workflows/praetor-api.yml
4cb9c80df5f1684457ae3a9e93ea653f25176998532593d894187d0e5647aa15  tools/apicompat/gate/main.go
